WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.122
Wuro e maski leɗɗe. Gooto go'o nder lesdi boowo.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.226
Fuɗɗoode, jemma tan woni. Sey Wuro maɓɓiti juuɗe maako, duniyaaru ummi.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.824
Sey o wurtini yiite dow le'i, ɗum laati naange.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.354
Leɗɗe boo ɗon ɓesda. Nden Wuro, Mawɗo, nastini duniyaaru maako kesal.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.386
Luttuɗum booɗɗum, ammaa walaa gaɗoowo. Wuro ɓooyii e hoore maako, o waɗi suudu mawngu.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.586
Goɗɗo go'o wari daga nder mayre nden, mawɗo e mo suuɗii. O yi'i juuɗe maako, nden kam o yi'iri Duubaajo maako.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.594
Wuro waɗi yiite dow maako. O waɗi ko'e maɓɓaaje, o hokki mo cembal.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.988
Sey neɗɗo o'o wurtini nyaamo, nyaamdu maɓɓiti. Ɗuum waɗi nyaamo wurti. O ɗon huuwa kuuje njamndi.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.818
Duuɗe bankooje ɗon ɓadake go'oto gaɗa. Wuro udditiri juuɗe maako, nden yimɓe woɗɓe ngari daga lesdi.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.610
Mawɗo jawdi hokki koo moye goɗɗum. Yimɓe fuu ɓe nganndi, ɓerɗe maɓɓe ɗon nyaamda.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.352
Wuro hawti bee kuugal maako, o welliti ɓe, o yahri dow.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.784
Ammaa to walaa Wuro, yimɓe ɗon mbaadi.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.296
Ndaa ko'e mon, ɗum to am!

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.676
Goomu maaɗa ɗon halki haa ɓernde!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:12.316
Caggal ɗuum, hayru leydi ɓeydii nder wuro ngoo. O dartini dariiɗo to suudu. Ɓiɗɗo boo ɗon mboya.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:21.768
Nder jemma nde'e, maccuɗo jawdi jooɗii tan yeeso mayru maako.

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:28.588
Wuro ! Yimɓe ɓe'e ɗon cembiɗa. Jaabbo yam !

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.632
Ɗoyre mawnini, ɓaawo maajum o dilli dow leɗɗe ceniiɗe.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:41.386
Mawɗo jawdi ɗon natti. Wuro wondi ton.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:55.642
Wuro ummi juuɗe maako haa leggal mawgal. Fuuɗeeji ɗi'e mbari, ɓe mbaɗi ɓorgo, ɗum ɓorni dow maaki.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:02.722
O meemi mo. Kanko woni ɓiɗɗo maako Dwo.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:07.282
Kanko woni ɓiɗɗo am. Onon maccuɗo leɗɗe, hoo'u ɗum.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:15.394
Dwo wurtini hoore maako, o fuɗɗiti ɓorgo. Fuujoowo on jaɓi mo nder juuɗe muuɗum.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.786
Ndaa. Hokka ɓe umroore.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.376
Wuro ƴetti haa asama, nden maccuɗo maɓɓiti.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:37.146
Nde nyalawma fu, o yahdi to ɓaawo jaŋde. Fuuɗeeje ɗon hoosi dow daande.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.642
Dwo wurti. Yimɓe gariiri'en njogii, ɓe kulnii.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:51.928
Ammaa Allah Mawɗo wari, o yi'i ɓiɗɗo Wuro nden o mawnini mo.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.600
Dwo dancing, nden gariiri hokki haa juuɗe maako.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:11.258
O wurtini leɗɗe hakkunde worɓe ɗiɗo ɓen. Ɓe njooɗi juuɗe maɓɓe, ɓe kawti.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:23.842
Hoolorgal ngal fuɗɗii. Dwo hawti bee maako, juuɗe maɓɓiti, nden kam hendu mawndu on timmi.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.336
Yimɓe nder gariiri fuu mbi'i Dwo.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:52.994
Nder jemma maajum Dwo wari nder leɗɗe. Gooduɗo ceede'en ɗon wurta bee hoore maako.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:00.184
Gila nden wakkati, to wuttudu fuɗɗii, yimɓe ɓeen mbaɗata huutoreeji.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.536
E dow, koode boo ɗon wara.
